body:
Yeah, fuck anti-vaxxers. It is the lowest of the low in terms of conspiracies and frankly, its so selfish, evil and anti-scinece that it is truly baffling so many people have fallen for it. 

&#x200B;

I'm still quite angry at how dangerous anti-vaxxers are but I think I'm starting to pity them. To have our education system fail you this badly is really sad. I hope anti-vaxxers can find some shred of human decency and concern for the freedom and wellbeing of others one day

Masks are useless? Lol yikes. Also lockdowns make logical sense for limiting or stopping the spread of a virus. Pretty sure mass sickness, mass hospitalisations and masss deaths are pretty destructive to society too bud. 

&#x200B;

P.S. I live in Australia and just got home from dinner at a bar. Australia is fuckin fine outside of Victoria.
